Sure, I agree completely.  But the discussion is only about making that
tedious stretch between the Castle and Rodney's tower/Vibrating Square
be about as hard as the rest of the game.

Basically a Nethack game is pretty hard and interesting from the start
until you get to the Castle, and from when you wake up Rodney until
Ascension.

I don't think people want to make either of those stretches any
tougher, so newbies would not be affected (unless your definition of
newbie includes people who can get to Gehennom; mine doesn't).

They just want to make the weak segment of the game be more on a par
with the rest.



